**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization employs replay-resistant authentication mechanisms within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant through FIDO2 security keys, time-based one-time passwords (TOTP), and certificate-based authentication managed by {{variables.accessControlAdministrator}}.

